The implementation is wired through two live paths: lunge applies the 10-tick grace, and mace records the impact position; the movement/fall code decrements and consumes the context. I also added the dispenser equipment path so `canEquipWithDispenser` and slot resolution have a real caller. I’m doing static review only now—no Cargo commands.
